      "block_pointer": "/42",
      "text": "The default behavior is Stop and Start, which sends a resync message consisting of a MIDI Clock Stop event followed by a MIDI Clock Start event; this works best with most MIDI devices. If set to Start Only, just the MIDI Clock Start event resync message is sent; this might work better for some devices. If set to Don’t Resync, no resync messages are sent."
